  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Solar business development and knowledge exchange visit to NL</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">When the project results are achieved, transparency and knowledge exchange between Dutch and Nigerian stakeholders, in particular customs of both countries, will be strengthened, enabling smoother trade and regulatory engagement. New financing pathways and sectoral investment opportunities will be activated, particularly in clean energy, agriculture, and healthcare, facilitating sustainable development and innovation. As a result, Dutch businesses will gain clearer market access and partnerships, accelerating bilateral economic cooperation and tangible business outcomes.</narrative>
  </description>
